  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>You can create a pocket of space that serves all your interests; whether it’s an astronomy tower, a gaming house or a palace for your ill-gotten gains, you can retreat into this space and invite others as you see fit. You learn the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.vPWMEyVTreMOoFnm]{Planar Palace} spell at 7th rank and add it to your Gambit’s Aces.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Special</span></span> If you also have the @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.classes.3N5bIrx1QeFPKfLy]{Starry Road} feat, you also learn the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.5bTt2CvYHPvaR7QQ]{Interplanar Teleport}<em> </em>spell and add it to your Gambit’s Aces.</p>"
